      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "این ذخیره، ژنراتورهای درمانگاه و پمپ‌های آب رو روشن نگه می‌داره. بیست بشکه باید برای این خدمات باقی بمونه. ترابری نظامی نمی‌تونه همه‌اش رو برداره.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH02M02SupplyLine/Voice/fa/supply_line-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.76,
      "sha256": "e5bd35647faebe62c30707ff136c9e4991996373da47bc46578c7d772af1d28d",
      "captionSha256": "6c1ba1782577d052fe3c8ca3fc10095f0ce28069a46ab062f633770bfe8612bf"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "supply_line-brief-03",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Agreed. Forty barrels: twenty for essential services, twenty for relief transport. Protect both trucks and all three sites, defeat the sabotage teams, then hold the reserve for twenty seconds. We have fifteen minutes.",
